WEBVTT

00:06.297 --> 00:09.092
ALL NAMES, PLACES, AND PRODUCTS
ARE FICTIONAL AND DRAMATIZED

00:09.175 --> 00:10.385
AND DO NOT REFLECT REALITY

00:43.418 --> 00:44.335
Did you remember?

00:44.419 --> 00:48.423
Yes. After Lee Seo-jin appeared
on Grandpas Over Flowers with a biker bag,

00:48.506 --> 00:50.300
it sold really well for some time.

00:50.383 --> 00:52.969
It was out of stock then,
so I stuck it out for years.

00:53.053 --> 00:55.680
I was finally able to buy it
when Returns aired.

00:55.764 --> 00:57.474
That's where I met that woman.

00:58.183 --> 01:00.852
That show aired in 2018,
so it was five years ago.

01:18.912 --> 01:21.081
Do you remember her name as well?

01:21.164 --> 01:22.874
Yes, her name was…

01:22.957 --> 01:24.667
It's not Mok Ga-hui, is it?

01:25.168 --> 01:27.212
It is! How did you know?

01:32.592 --> 01:33.802
Hey, it's not here.

01:33.885 --> 01:35.095
It's not?

01:35.929 --> 01:37.138
This is driving me nuts.

01:40.642 --> 01:42.310
Why didn't I recognize her at once?

01:42.393 --> 01:45.271
She had a face that's hard to forget.
Damn it.

01:45.355 --> 01:46.439
Because she was pretty?

01:49.400 --> 01:50.819
For a different reason.

01:55.990 --> 01:56.825
I found it!

01:56.908 --> 01:58.159
2018 EMPLOYEE EXCLUSIVE SALE

01:58.243 --> 02:00.745
We will begin entry shortly.

02:01.246 --> 02:06.292
Please have your invitation
and employee ID ready for a smooth entry.

02:06.918 --> 02:09.504
We will begin entry shortly.

02:10.004 --> 02:13.716
Please have your invitation
and employee ID ready…

02:13.800 --> 02:15.927
- Let's start there.
- We should've come sooner.

02:16.010 --> 02:17.470
- It's fine--
- What the…

02:17.554 --> 02:18.596
- Ouch!
- What the hell?

02:18.680 --> 02:20.223
- She cut in…
- What's she doing?

02:20.890 --> 02:21.975
What's with her?

02:22.684 --> 02:24.853
- She should apologize.
- It's fine.

02:26.187 --> 02:27.063
She has no decency.

02:27.147 --> 02:28.523
- Let's take it this way.
- Okay.

02:31.109 --> 02:32.777
One, two, three!

02:33.903 --> 02:35.405
One, two, three!

02:36.197 --> 02:37.532
Hey, my face looks so big!

02:37.615 --> 02:39.617
- Okay, we'll move up.
- You come to the back.

02:43.288 --> 02:44.414
- Oh my!
- Oh my gosh!

02:44.497 --> 02:45.790
What are you doing?

02:45.874 --> 02:49.127
- You took my picture. Delete it!
- We weren't taking your picture!

02:49.210 --> 02:51.588
- Why are you doing this?
- What a crazy bitch!

02:52.755 --> 02:53.923
Why are you doing this?

02:55.300 --> 02:56.342
Keep back.

02:56.426 --> 02:58.553
Your boyfriend bought you that!

02:58.636 --> 03:00.638
Hey, what's she doing
with your cell phone?

03:00.722 --> 03:01.723
What's with her?

03:02.223 --> 03:03.057
Hey!

03:04.809 --> 03:06.352
This is a Van Cleef!

03:11.816 --> 03:14.152
The Sweet line isn't available in onyx.

03:15.612 --> 03:18.865
Did your boyfriend buy you a fake,
or is he a fake too?

03:20.283 --> 03:21.993
Excuse me! You can't just walk off!

03:22.076 --> 03:22.994
It's fine.

03:23.995 --> 03:25.705
- Seriously?
- I'll get it serviced.

03:25.788 --> 03:27.040
She's totally crazy!

03:27.540 --> 03:28.625
Hey, are you okay?

03:28.708 --> 03:30.376
- Just because she was in…
- Are you okay?

03:34.297 --> 03:36.841
None show her face,
so they're not very useful,

03:36.925 --> 03:38.051
but I sent them anyway.

03:39.719 --> 03:41.638
No, they mean a lot.

03:44.891 --> 03:46.434
Doors closing.

04:02.951 --> 04:05.119
- What the…
- What's that smell?

04:05.203 --> 04:07.789
Thank you for visiting Samwol today.

04:08.289 --> 04:10.708
- He smells like trash.
- I know, right?

04:12.335 --> 04:13.962
How can he go to a store like that?

04:17.757 --> 04:20.635
- What's he doing in a department store?
- God, he stinks!

04:35.441 --> 04:37.860
THE ART OF SARAH

04:40.113 --> 04:43.658
MOK GA-HUI

04:52.500 --> 04:54.168
Sir!

04:55.670 --> 04:56.504
Here.

05:04.137 --> 05:06.931
Mok Ga-hui worked right here

05:07.432 --> 05:09.851
at Samwol Department Store five years ago.

05:09.934 --> 05:11.352
According to Woo Hyo-eun,

05:11.436 --> 05:14.105
Sarah Kim was pushing
to get a spot in this place

05:14.188 --> 05:15.606
up until she was murdered.

05:15.690 --> 05:20.028
And the sewer where the body was found
is also connected to this place.

05:21.362 --> 05:24.991
What does this place have to do
with the murder?

05:26.492 --> 05:28.328
That's what we're here to find out.

05:30.621 --> 05:32.415
What if it's a person, not a place?

05:32.957 --> 05:33.958
What is?

05:34.042 --> 05:35.543
Where the arrow points.

05:36.836 --> 05:38.296
Doors closing.

05:47.972 --> 05:52.060
The police requested information
as part of a voluntary investigation.

05:52.143 --> 05:55.188
So Samwol isn't obligated
to provide the requested documents

05:55.271 --> 05:58.274
and may be selective in what we submit.

05:59.400 --> 06:00.568
So I was told.

06:01.069 --> 06:02.945
I understand you have a lot to lose.

06:03.446 --> 06:05.948
After all, you own more
than anyone else in South Korea.

06:06.032 --> 06:08.368
"Samwol Department Store
chairwoman Choi Chae-u

06:08.451 --> 06:11.454
even tricked into signing
a lease agreement by con artist."

06:11.537 --> 06:13.331
The lease agreement in question

06:13.414 --> 06:16.042
was reviewed and deemed invalid
by our MD Team.

06:16.125 --> 06:19.962
We've already addressed the issue
by disciplining the employee responsible,

06:20.046 --> 06:21.839
per our internal regulations.

06:21.923 --> 06:23.257
So I was told.

06:23.341 --> 06:24.592
If that's the case,

06:25.343 --> 06:27.303
it means you were aware

06:27.845 --> 06:29.472
that Sarah Kim was a con artist.

06:33.142 --> 06:35.603
The security footage
could help identify the suspect,

06:35.686 --> 06:36.813
but they won't share it.

06:36.896 --> 06:38.022
They're a major company.

06:38.106 --> 06:39.690
We need irrefutable evidence

06:39.774 --> 06:42.151
for things like a summons
or a search warrant.

06:46.030 --> 06:47.281
From this moment on,

06:47.782 --> 06:51.619
we're tracking down Mok Ga-hui,
who worked at Samwol five years ago.

06:51.702 --> 06:54.414
The more connections with Choi,
the better.

06:54.497 --> 06:55.832
Wait, Mok Ga-hui?

06:55.915 --> 06:57.708
Don't tell me it's that Mok Ga-hui?

06:59.627 --> 07:00.711
It's here somewhere…

07:00.795 --> 07:02.547
Who's "that" Mok Ga-hui?

07:02.630 --> 07:04.632
I shared an office
with the cybercrime team

07:04.715 --> 07:07.135
when I was stationed at Namdaemun.

07:07.635 --> 07:10.430
I heard that name endlessly,
so I remember it.

07:13.224 --> 07:14.058
WANTED FUGITIVE

07:14.767 --> 07:16.144
She was hiding right here.

07:19.564 --> 07:21.899
REWARD UP TO 5 MILLION WON
WANTED FUGITIVE FOR FRAUD

07:22.650 --> 07:26.195
PERSONAL INFORMATION: MOK GA-HUI (F, 26)
TATTOO NEAR ANKLE

07:45.506 --> 07:46.883
Are you looking for this?

07:46.966 --> 07:49.051
The Cheongdam Goddess scam case.

07:50.761 --> 07:54.223
She listed luxury goods as second-hand
and built trust with buyers,

07:54.307 --> 07:56.267
then took the money and vanished.

07:56.350 --> 07:58.936
She swindled a whopping 500 million won.

08:06.569 --> 08:08.362
Are these all the documents you have?

08:08.863 --> 08:11.073
What about fingerprints or DNA evidence?

08:12.283 --> 08:14.202
It's like I'm being audited.

08:15.036 --> 08:18.206
You're from Violent Crimes, right?
What's going on?

08:18.289 --> 08:21.751
We suspect Mok Ga-hui to be
the victim of a recent murder.

08:24.378 --> 08:26.088
I think you're mistaken.

08:26.589 --> 08:29.008
Mok Ga-hui died five years ago.

08:37.600 --> 08:39.101
She committed suicide by jumping.

08:39.185 --> 08:40.436
It was for a common reason.

08:40.520 --> 08:41.521
Financial hardship.

08:42.021 --> 08:44.148
She was heavily in debt to loan sharks,

08:44.732 --> 08:47.527
apparently from buying hordes
of luxury goods.

08:49.612 --> 08:53.866
She left the place a total mess,
but soaked her suicide note in perfume.

08:54.367 --> 08:56.452
It was downright insane.

09:00.790 --> 09:04.210
See the shiny thing she's holding tightly
as she jumps?

09:04.877 --> 09:06.254
That's a limited edition too.

09:06.337 --> 09:10.758
The damn thing must've been dear to her.
She couldn't let it go, even in death.

09:10.841 --> 09:13.219
- Was the body recovered?
- No.

09:13.302 --> 09:15.805
She went missing,
so the case was suspended.

09:15.888 --> 09:19.684
That means it became a cold case,
so why did you conclude she was dead?

09:20.434 --> 09:23.688
The reason and circumstances were clear,
and a suicide note was found.

09:23.771 --> 09:26.274
Most importantly,
there was no evidence she was alive.

09:26.774 --> 09:28.693
Even if someone lives like a ghost,

09:28.776 --> 09:30.111
they still leave traces

09:30.194 --> 09:34.073
like hospital visits, bank accounts,
or delivery-app records.

09:34.156 --> 09:36.742
But there was nothing.

09:37.618 --> 09:39.579
CHEONGDAM GODDESS SCAM CASE
SUICIDE NOTE

09:40.746 --> 09:42.957
Could they really be two different people?

09:48.713 --> 09:51.465
Similar physical description
and criminal offense type.

09:52.258 --> 09:54.218
Do you think that's all a coincidence?

09:56.137 --> 10:00.224
We have no evidence she's alive,
but none that she's dead either.

10:00.891 --> 10:04.186
If she had been impersonating Sarah Kim
for the past five years,

10:05.730 --> 10:08.107
it makes sense she was declared missing.

10:10.568 --> 10:13.738
Do you know The Cuckoo's Calling
by Robert Galbraith?

10:14.238 --> 10:15.072
No.

10:15.156 --> 10:18.451
Right after the book was published,
an anonymous Twitter user

10:18.534 --> 10:22.538
claimed Robert
was just J.K. Rowling's pen name.

10:23.039 --> 10:26.917
After some debate, it was revealed
that the two were the same person. How?

10:28.586 --> 10:29.754
By the book's prologue.

10:32.173 --> 10:35.926
"Unhappy is he whose fame
makes his misfortunes famous."

10:36.010 --> 10:38.095
Because of the quote by Lucius Accius.

10:40.681 --> 10:43.726
Lucius is Malfoy's father's name,

10:44.226 --> 10:47.688
and who's the classic case of fame
making one's misfortune famous too?

10:47.772 --> 10:48.731
Harry Potter!

10:50.900 --> 10:53.694
Even language has fingerprints.
All we need is one sentence.

10:54.779 --> 10:56.530
No, we just need one word.

10:56.614 --> 10:59.492
- But Mok never wrote a book.
- She did write something else.

11:00.951 --> 11:01.786
The suicide note!

11:01.869 --> 11:03.329
Wait, did you steal that?

11:03.412 --> 11:06.207
What do you mean by "steal"?
I found it on the floor.

11:09.460 --> 11:10.795
I'm giving you fair warning.

11:11.379 --> 11:13.756
We'll make countless enemies
the moment I open this.

11:14.256 --> 11:15.841
We'd be attacking the errors

11:15.925 --> 11:18.219
of the case team, the courts,
and the prosecution.

11:18.844 --> 11:21.138
So if you want out, now's your chance.

11:43.327 --> 11:45.621
I tend to be quite daring.

11:47.248 --> 11:49.917
We're not leaving until we find a lead.

11:50.751 --> 11:51.585
Yes, sir.

11:56.215 --> 12:00.720
People trust others
knowing they shouldn't,

12:01.929 --> 12:04.265
trust themselves,
believing they'll be different,

12:05.474 --> 12:08.060
believe the world,
thinking it'll be different this time,

12:09.311 --> 12:13.149
and believe in lies
even while knowing everything is a lie.

12:13.232 --> 12:14.483
Mok Ga-hui?

12:15.776 --> 12:16.861
You're 27?

12:18.487 --> 12:20.489
Usually they don't hire such old newbies.

12:21.407 --> 12:23.242
Do you have this one size up?

12:23.743 --> 12:24.827
What do you think?

12:29.957 --> 12:33.002
Who's going to buy anything
from a salesperson who's a large?

12:49.685 --> 12:52.021
Don't ever use the client bathrooms.

12:52.521 --> 12:54.899
The same goes
for the elevators and the escalators.

12:55.399 --> 12:58.319
That can trigger complaints
for causing discomfort,

12:58.402 --> 13:01.322
so don't even hint at it
in front of the clients.

13:01.405 --> 13:03.574
Just say you're on a break.

13:04.074 --> 13:07.036
These are this season's new releases.
Learn them by this weekend.

13:08.245 --> 13:10.122
I don't need until the weekend.

13:10.206 --> 13:13.626
- I've already memorized them all.
- But they're not even in Korea yet.

13:15.336 --> 13:18.297
I just like how knowing more
lets you see and understand more.

13:18.798 --> 13:20.299
You won't last long here.

13:20.382 --> 13:23.010
People who talk like that
always disappear and quit.

13:23.636 --> 13:24.595
No.

13:25.554 --> 13:27.556
I'm here to stay for good.

13:28.057 --> 13:30.976
Fellow Samwol family members,

13:31.060 --> 13:34.855
we will be ready to serve
our valuable clients in ten minutes.

13:34.939 --> 13:37.399
Please complete all preparations.

13:39.860 --> 13:41.862
Announcement from the control room.

13:42.446 --> 13:44.198
Fellow Samwol family members,

13:44.698 --> 13:46.992
thank you for your hard work today.

13:47.660 --> 13:53.415
Please unplug all devices in the store
and turn off the power before you leave.

13:53.499 --> 13:57.920
Please ensure all high-value display items
are properly secured.

13:59.171 --> 14:03.384
Please report any issues
to the control room as soon as they occur.

14:15.896 --> 14:16.981
Ga-hui.

14:17.648 --> 14:19.024
What are you doing here?

14:20.192 --> 14:22.736
How do you think the rich became rich?

14:24.196 --> 14:26.115
Well, they were born that way,
don't you think?

14:27.908 --> 14:29.869
You know, I have a dream now.

14:35.249 --> 14:37.626
I want to become a person
who suits this bag.

14:40.129 --> 14:43.966
That might be possible
if you had one meal a day for ten years.

14:44.717 --> 14:47.678
Well, let's think about that
after we close up, shall we?

14:48.470 --> 14:49.930
Come on. Hurry up.

14:55.686 --> 14:57.646
God, this is seriously driving me crazy.

15:04.486 --> 15:07.239
Something big is coming. Something big.

15:07.740 --> 15:09.074
Are you all religious?

15:09.909 --> 15:11.160
Pray. Even if you're not.

15:11.744 --> 15:13.829
Please let it be anyone but me.

15:14.788 --> 15:16.206
Why? What's going on?

15:16.290 --> 15:18.208
Regardless of the reason,

15:18.292 --> 15:20.794
any inventory discrepancy
is considered a loss.

15:21.337 --> 15:23.130
And we make up the full amount.

15:23.213 --> 15:25.174
That's Samwol Department Store's policy.

15:25.257 --> 15:26.091
So pray.

15:26.759 --> 15:28.218
October 14th.

15:28.302 --> 15:29.803
Who closed up that day?

15:30.721 --> 15:32.014
- October…
- Fourteenth…

15:37.311 --> 15:39.772
OCTOBER 14, SUNDAY
CLOSING SHIFT: MOK GA-HUI

15:43.359 --> 15:46.362
Misfortune struck without warning,
like a disaster.

15:57.539 --> 16:00.876
Why did you leave your station?

16:01.418 --> 16:02.962
Was it something important?

16:05.297 --> 16:08.217
It had better have been
something very important.

16:08.300 --> 16:10.928
At least then you'd feel less wronged.

16:16.767 --> 16:17.977
I was on a break.

16:18.060 --> 16:19.395
Couldn't you have held it in?

16:19.478 --> 16:21.313
I'd been holding it in all day.

16:23.691 --> 16:26.819
This wouldn't have happened
if staff could use client bathrooms.

16:26.902 --> 16:30.239
It's a long walk through the back hall
to the staff bathroom,

16:30.322 --> 16:31.991
but even then, there's a line.

16:32.074 --> 16:35.369
The basement one is less crowded,
but I have to take the staff elevator,

16:35.452 --> 16:39.248
which is also around the back hallway,
and it stops on every floor, so I have to…

16:40.082 --> 16:40.916
Damn it.

16:41.917 --> 16:43.752
I have to wait through the long ride.

16:46.046 --> 16:48.090
Going to the bathroom was such a struggle.

16:48.173 --> 16:49.717
I mean, it's just the bathroom.

16:51.635 --> 16:53.554
It was only once.

16:54.179 --> 16:56.765
What can I do? That's the store policy.

16:57.266 --> 17:00.436
You know that we can't recover the items
even if she's caught.

17:00.936 --> 17:03.188
I swear it's a better world for criminals.

17:03.272 --> 17:07.109
Just think of it
as an expensive life lesson learned.

17:09.903 --> 17:10.821
How

17:11.613 --> 17:13.449
much do I have to pay?

17:17.161 --> 17:18.245
Fifty million won.

17:30.507 --> 17:31.341
Ouch.

17:39.349 --> 17:40.184
Ouch.

18:00.621 --> 18:02.206
Where did things go wrong?

18:07.586 --> 18:09.088
- Add one A!
- Okay.

18:09.588 --> 18:11.298
Five, you said? Add two more.

18:11.381 --> 18:12.549
Got one more B.

18:12.633 --> 18:14.760
All right. Dessert served to table two.

18:16.553 --> 18:17.846
Get the sauce ready.

18:22.684 --> 18:25.270
Two steaks going out to table four.

18:25.854 --> 18:28.232
Where did things go wrong?

18:32.736 --> 18:34.279
Didn't know you smoked.

18:36.073 --> 18:37.366
I started.

18:38.492 --> 18:40.786
I figured this was my only way
to get breaks.

18:42.162 --> 18:43.247
Here.

18:43.789 --> 18:45.791
The girls and I all pitched in a bit.

18:46.750 --> 18:48.335
It's not much, but I hope it helps.

18:55.926 --> 18:56.927
See you later.

19:00.180 --> 19:02.432
Where did things go wrong?

19:05.060 --> 19:08.397
Are you sure you won't regret it?
We can't pay you even if it bombs.

19:08.480 --> 19:10.232
Just make sure you pay me properly.

19:18.907 --> 19:21.410
Okay, I'm practicing script tattoos.

19:21.910 --> 19:23.745
Is there a specific phrase you'd like?

19:29.001 --> 19:31.920
Where did things go wrong?

19:52.900 --> 19:56.570
After thinking it over,
I found my way back to when I was born.

19:58.989 --> 20:02.826
TO BE OPERATED
BY AUTHORIZED PERSONNEL ONLY

20:02.910 --> 20:05.078
Ma'am, are you going to the employee sale?

20:05.662 --> 20:07.873
It coincides
with my in-laws' ancestral rites.

20:07.956 --> 20:10.751
- Oh no!
- Damn that husband of mine.

20:10.834 --> 20:13.921
- It's supposed to be the best ever.
- Don't ever get married.

20:15.339 --> 20:16.173
Oh my.

20:16.715 --> 20:17.633
Yes, perfect!

20:17.716 --> 20:20.552
Ga-hui, would you like to earn some money?

20:21.553 --> 20:22.387
Sorry?

20:22.971 --> 20:25.641
There's going to be an employee sale
for store staff.

20:25.724 --> 20:28.060
Luxury goods at those prices are a steal.

20:28.143 --> 20:30.771
If you manage to make purchases
on my behalf,

20:30.854 --> 20:32.689
I'll compensate you generously.

20:33.232 --> 20:35.150
Mok Ga-hui of Samwol Department Store.

20:35.234 --> 20:36.485
You may enter.

20:39.238 --> 20:41.114
Lee Hyeon-suk of Samwol Department Store.

20:41.198 --> 20:42.241
Samwol Department…

20:44.785 --> 20:45.619
Bags!

20:45.702 --> 20:46.870
Please be careful.

20:59.091 --> 21:02.010
At that moment,
I saw a ray of hope for my life too.

21:07.057 --> 21:08.850
What are you doing?

21:08.934 --> 21:10.477
I'll buy it. Wait, hold on.

21:10.560 --> 21:11.895
No, I'm buying it!

21:11.979 --> 21:13.814
- I grabbed it.
- What's with you?

21:32.124 --> 21:33.792
PLEASE ENTER YOUR NICKNAME

21:33.875 --> 21:34.960
CHEONGDAM GODDESS

21:35.043 --> 21:37.462
JOIN

21:37.546 --> 21:38.463
WELCOME TO NOBILITY

21:41.800 --> 21:44.386
SELLING CHEAP DUE TO CIRCUMSTANCES
NO WEAR AND TEAR

21:45.804 --> 21:46.930
OPEN TO NEGOTIATION

21:47.014 --> 21:48.307
POST

21:59.192 --> 22:00.444
COMMENTS

22:00.527 --> 22:02.738
Samwol Department Store's First Lounge

22:02.821 --> 22:07.117
ensures that our most valued clients
can relax comfortably while shopping

22:07.200 --> 22:08.660
by offering various services…

22:11.621 --> 22:12.873
NO COMMENTS

22:15.751 --> 22:17.210
MANAGER OH SEON-JEONG
ON A BREAK?

22:17.294 --> 22:18.378
HURRY, THE BOSS IS HERE

22:25.177 --> 22:26.053
I'm about to burst!

22:26.136 --> 22:28.221
Hurry!

22:28.722 --> 22:30.307
So gross.

22:30.932 --> 22:32.851
Why are you going
to the bathroom so often?

22:32.934 --> 22:34.394
I feel better now.

22:35.062 --> 22:36.521
It's because I took enzymes.

22:36.605 --> 22:38.982
It's a group-buy item from Gemma,
and it sold out.

22:39.066 --> 22:39.900
Really?

22:39.983 --> 22:41.526
Should I get some too?

22:41.610 --> 22:44.863
You know, this vintage Chanel bag
Gemma carries is sold out.

22:45.364 --> 22:46.615
Where did she get it?

22:47.115 --> 22:48.992
I can't seem to find it anywhere.

22:49.618 --> 22:50.786
Yeah, that one's pretty.

22:50.869 --> 22:52.287
She takes good pictures.

22:52.871 --> 22:56.124
They urge you to buy it right away.
She has over a million followers.

22:56.208 --> 22:59.127
That's understandable.
Her posts make you want to buy the items.

23:03.632 --> 23:04.800
GEMMA

23:34.746 --> 23:38.417
SELLING SINCE I GOT THE SAME BAG AS A GIFT

23:38.500 --> 23:41.628
THIS ITEM IS HARD TO FIND THESE DAYS,
SO I'VE ADDED A PREMIUM

23:41.711 --> 23:42.963
POST

23:58.437 --> 23:59.729
I'LL BUY IT. I CAN PAY NOW

23:59.813 --> 24:01.314
IS IT NEW? PRISTINE CONDITION?

24:01.398 --> 24:02.941
AUTHENTIC? ALL COMPONENTS INCLUDED?

24:07.362 --> 24:08.363
I'LL BUY IT! PLEASE!

24:08.447 --> 24:09.698
I REALLY WANTED THIS ONE

24:09.781 --> 24:10.866
PLEASE MESSAGE ME!

24:13.034 --> 24:16.496
FOR EXECUTIVES, EMPLOYEES,
AND PARTNER COMPANIES

24:16.580 --> 24:20.459
SAMWOL GROUP YEAR-END SALE
FOR EMPLOYEES AND EXECUTIVES

24:43.482 --> 24:45.442
God, where did my employee ID go?

24:47.777 --> 24:49.446
Did you happen to see my ID?

24:49.529 --> 24:50.906
No, I haven't seen it.

24:52.365 --> 24:55.410
Please have your employee ID
and invitation ready in advance.

24:55.494 --> 24:56.495
MOBILE INVITATION

25:12.677 --> 25:15.805
TRANSACTION COMPLETE

25:55.845 --> 25:57.764
PRETTY IMPULSE BUY
NOT MY USUAL STYLE

26:01.851 --> 26:04.938
- All good upstairs?
- Yes, things look absolutely fine.

26:10.902 --> 26:12.320
I'm sorry for the delay.

26:15.282 --> 26:16.408
What is this?

26:16.491 --> 26:17.826
Fifty million won.

26:19.160 --> 26:19.995
What?

26:21.288 --> 26:23.039
I'll get changed.

26:24.249 --> 26:25.250
I mean, this is…

26:34.843 --> 26:36.344
Oh, you got a tattoo.

26:36.428 --> 26:37.512
What does it mean?

26:38.680 --> 26:40.348
Splendid melancholy.

26:41.391 --> 26:42.934
"Splendid melancholy"?

26:44.894 --> 26:48.023
It's like "miserable rich"
or "beautiful trash."

26:49.816 --> 26:53.153
Right now,
I feel like miserable, melancholic trash.

26:53.236 --> 26:55.989
What if money made money?
50 million becomes 500 million,

26:56.489 --> 26:58.825
then 500 million becomes 5 billion.

26:59.701 --> 27:03.496
The one choice

27:03.580 --> 27:07.000
That will change your life

27:07.083 --> 27:10.378
They say the jingling sound
of the charms brings you luck.

27:10.462 --> 27:11.880
Do you think it suits me?

27:11.963 --> 27:14.466
Of course. It's perfect for you.

27:17.344 --> 27:18.386
I'll take it.

27:19.804 --> 27:21.473
We don't have any in stock for now.

27:21.556 --> 27:24.601
It may take a while for you to receive it.
Would that be all right?

27:26.186 --> 27:28.313
Why ask?
What will you do if it's not okay?

27:30.065 --> 27:30.899
I apologize.

27:30.982 --> 27:32.567
Never mind. Here's the deposit.

27:32.651 --> 27:34.986
Yes. Please wait just a moment.

27:35.570 --> 27:38.114
I'm afraid you can't purchase these.

27:38.198 --> 27:39.491
Sorry? Why not?

27:39.574 --> 27:42.327
You can only purchase
up to two million won per person.

27:42.410 --> 27:43.662
Since when?

27:44.829 --> 27:49.042
The brand implemented a purchasing limit
due to illegal invitation issues.

27:49.125 --> 27:52.837
Apparently, dealers were caught
reselling the items recently.

27:53.838 --> 27:56.716
So, would you like to buy
up to the two-million-won limit?

28:03.390 --> 28:04.391
REMINDER FOR MOK X-HUI

28:04.474 --> 28:05.392
PRINCIPAL DUE: 01/07/19

28:05.475 --> 28:06.893
PRINCIPAL: ₩50,000,000
RATE: 24%

28:06.976 --> 28:08.395
THE ONE CAPITAL

28:15.694 --> 28:16.986
It's 50 million won.

28:17.070 --> 28:18.530
Come on. Damn it.

28:19.030 --> 28:20.156
There's money missing.

28:20.240 --> 28:23.660
That's 50 million won.
I brought the principal right back.

28:23.743 --> 28:24.661
Exactly.

28:24.744 --> 28:27.956
Why only bring back the principal?
What about the interest?

28:28.873 --> 28:30.750
Well, you see…

28:33.086 --> 28:35.588
Something came up,
so I can't pay it back right away.

28:36.089 --> 28:38.425
Whatever it takes,
I'll have it by next month.

28:38.508 --> 28:39.718
Will you be okay with it?

28:39.801 --> 28:42.011
By next month,
you'll have more interest to pay.

28:43.179 --> 28:45.557
Look, why don't you just pay it off now?

28:45.640 --> 28:47.559
I'll lend it to you.

28:47.642 --> 28:48.476
Hey.

28:52.772 --> 28:54.023
Here we go.

28:55.942 --> 28:58.027
Give me your thumb.

28:58.111 --> 28:59.946
- Ouch!
- Okay, relax.

29:04.576 --> 29:06.077
That's a good girl.

29:14.878 --> 29:17.672
Here you go. Come on, take it.

29:19.924 --> 29:21.509
Here's me lending you the money,

29:23.261 --> 29:24.679
and me receiving it.

29:26.931 --> 29:30.268
Thank you again
for using our services today,

29:30.852 --> 29:33.855
Mok Ga-hui of Samwol Department Store.

29:34.647 --> 29:37.859
Interest piled up,
and 5 million became 50 million,

29:37.942 --> 29:39.694
then 50 million became 500 million.

29:40.945 --> 29:42.155
Pay back the money!

29:42.238 --> 29:43.490
Listen, everyone.

29:44.574 --> 29:47.869
A bitch who refuses
to pay back the money she owes

29:48.369 --> 29:51.372
works in the luxury section
of the Samwol Department Store.

29:51.456 --> 29:52.290
Mok Ga-hui!

29:53.792 --> 29:55.418
Hey! Damn it!

29:55.502 --> 29:56.377
Stop right there!

29:56.461 --> 29:57.378
Out of the way!

29:57.462 --> 29:58.588
Mok Ga-hui!

30:04.761 --> 30:06.930
Hey, Ga-hui. Mok Ga-hui.

30:07.013 --> 30:08.598
Fucking hell.

30:15.563 --> 30:17.148
You really think she's in there?

30:17.232 --> 30:18.358
Hurry up!

31:13.580 --> 31:16.749
No matter how hard I try to escape,
I find myself in a deeper abyss.

31:20.086 --> 31:21.838
Take care of the inventory for now.

31:22.630 --> 31:24.507
And don't let me catch sight of you.

31:27.760 --> 31:30.054
Where there is light, there is darkness.

31:31.014 --> 31:33.474
Why did I have to be the darkness?

31:41.274 --> 31:43.818
VALUED CLIENT MOK GA-HUI
YOUR BAG IS READY FOR PICKUP

32:30.114 --> 32:32.116
Please!

32:42.877 --> 32:44.921
Fuck.

32:57.642 --> 33:00.645
What did I ever do that was so wrong?

33:02.063 --> 33:03.523
Why are you doing this to me?

33:04.023 --> 33:06.693
Why?

34:05.793 --> 34:08.046
You've got to burn to shine.

34:35.782 --> 34:37.575
MOK GA-HUI

34:51.422 --> 34:52.590
Run.

34:54.008 --> 34:55.968
This is not a place for you.

35:19.033 --> 35:22.578
I have decided to kill myself today.

35:35.967 --> 35:38.427
MOK GA-HUI

35:43.683 --> 35:47.061
But before I died,
I wanted to prove that I had existed.

35:49.063 --> 35:50.273
Where the hell is Ga-hui?

35:50.356 --> 35:52.650
- Seon-jeong, aren't you her friend?
- Well, I…

35:52.733 --> 35:54.068
- I can't reach her.
- You what?

35:54.152 --> 35:55.153
Try calling her.

35:55.236 --> 35:56.237
That little…

35:56.988 --> 35:58.447
- Oh God!
- I'm sorry.

36:02.326 --> 36:03.870
How would you like this handled?

36:05.371 --> 36:08.457
Just put it down as a disturbance
caused by a sprinkler malfunction.

36:08.541 --> 36:10.293
Processing request.

36:14.088 --> 36:17.049
Your transaction is complete. Please…

36:43.075 --> 36:44.493
Though I will be shattered,

36:44.994 --> 36:46.787
I shall do so brilliantly.

36:48.122 --> 36:49.123
MOK GA-HUI

36:51.918 --> 36:52.752
"Fuck it."

36:53.252 --> 36:54.253
"I love you."

36:56.005 --> 36:57.048
Luxury goods?

36:58.049 --> 37:00.176
I really do like you.

37:01.385 --> 37:04.263
Yet I really hate you.

37:05.681 --> 37:06.682
Still…

37:08.267 --> 37:09.185
I love you.

37:10.436 --> 37:12.480
Even so, I hate you.

37:12.980 --> 37:14.232
However,

37:14.315 --> 37:15.858
I want to possess you.

37:15.942 --> 37:17.902
But I hate you.

37:18.402 --> 37:19.654
Nevertheless,

37:19.737 --> 37:22.281
I want to be with you forever.

37:22.949 --> 37:25.326
I wonder how you really feel?

37:29.914 --> 37:33.376
Do you think it's a love-hate thing?
It might be surprisingly human.

37:33.459 --> 37:36.128
Professing love and hate
without using conjunctions.

37:37.004 --> 37:38.589
Ugly but beautiful.

37:39.131 --> 37:42.009
- This is more human.
- It doesn't contradict what we know.

37:42.510 --> 37:45.096
It's complex and ever-changing,
exactly like Sarah Kim.

37:45.179 --> 37:47.014
I mean, like Mok Ga-hui.

37:47.098 --> 37:50.017
She gets 500 million won overnight
and then commits suicide?

37:50.518 --> 37:54.146
Now there's a contradiction.
Where did all the money disappear to?

37:55.106 --> 37:58.442
But no matter how many times I read this,

37:58.943 --> 38:01.612
not a single sentence suggests
Sarah Kim wrote it.

38:02.947 --> 38:03.906
What if we flip it…

38:06.450 --> 38:09.203
and try to find Mok Ga-hui from Sarah Kim?

38:10.079 --> 38:14.166
There have to be traces of her,
even if she pretends to be someone else.

38:14.250 --> 38:17.712
A rose will still smell like a rose,
no matter what name you call it by.

38:21.007 --> 38:22.258
LUXURY GOODS

38:25.094 --> 38:27.054
SPLENDID MELANCHOLY

38:34.895 --> 38:36.981
What if we look for Mok Ga-hui
among these?

38:37.481 --> 38:38.316
Luxury goods.

38:38.399 --> 38:40.651
Splendid melancholy. Handbags.

38:42.653 --> 38:44.488
Maybe it needs to be more intuitive,

38:45.197 --> 38:47.825
or maybe it's where the three overlap.

38:48.951 --> 38:50.661
A luxury bag

38:51.287 --> 38:54.290
that introduced her
to a feeling of splendid melancholy…

38:55.624 --> 38:58.419
Do you recall the bag Mok had
when she committed suicide?

38:58.502 --> 39:00.546
Yes, the really shiny one.

39:08.012 --> 39:09.096
I found it, sir.

39:09.180 --> 39:11.265
It's the 2018 Lady Dior Collection.

39:18.522 --> 39:19.565
YOU GOT TO BURN TO SHINE

39:22.318 --> 39:25.154
THOUGH I WILL BE SHATTERED,
I SHALL DO SO BRILLIANTLY

39:25.780 --> 39:27.698
The phrases match the suicide note.

39:28.199 --> 39:30.826
What date did you say
Cheongdam Goddess posted that?

39:30.910 --> 39:32.495
Wait, give me a second.

39:33.996 --> 39:38.125
I GOT THE LUXURY BOUDOIR BAG LOVED
BY EUROPEAN ROYALS FOR 100 YEARS

39:38.209 --> 39:41.796
December 26, 2018,
the day Mok Ga-hui committed suicide.

39:41.879 --> 39:43.881
And when was Sarah Kim first seen?

39:43.964 --> 39:46.175
According to Jeong Yeo-jin's statement,

39:47.009 --> 39:49.387
that was also December 26, 2018.

39:50.846 --> 39:52.848
Now we know what happened to the money.

39:54.475 --> 39:56.143
Mok Ga-hui didn't want to die.

39:56.644 --> 39:58.312
She wanted to live differently.

39:58.396 --> 40:01.065
No matter how hard she tried,
her reality never changed.

40:01.148 --> 40:03.359
She clung to the illusion of luxury goods

40:04.068 --> 40:05.611
until she fell down the abyss.

40:06.112 --> 40:07.530
That's when she decided.

40:07.613 --> 40:09.240
If she couldn't change reality,

40:09.949 --> 40:11.200
she would change herself.

40:20.209 --> 40:22.628
Just as J.K. Rowling became
Robert Galbraith,

40:22.711 --> 40:24.463
Mok Ga-hui became Sarah Kim.

40:25.881 --> 40:29.009
And the Lady Dior,
which was hugely symbolic for Mok…

40:36.308 --> 40:37.601
became Boudoir.

40:52.158 --> 40:55.035
I told you to catch a killer,
not go around wasting your time.

40:55.995 --> 40:57.788
And what's all this about Dior?

40:58.289 --> 41:01.125
Are you saying
a dead person has come back to life?

41:01.792 --> 41:03.085
A sloppy investigation

41:03.752 --> 41:05.838
has turned a living person
into a dead one.

41:06.422 --> 41:07.631
- What?
- It wasn't concrete.

41:07.715 --> 41:12.178
The evidence only hinted at Mok's suicide.
They never searched the reservoir.

41:12.678 --> 41:15.306
It's not too late to search and confirm.

41:15.389 --> 41:17.475
If a body is not found,

41:17.558 --> 41:19.977
we can prove Mok didn't commit suicide.

41:20.060 --> 41:21.645
And this suicide note will serve

41:22.354 --> 41:24.064
as justification for the search.

41:37.411 --> 41:40.206
If they do find a body,

41:40.831 --> 41:42.166
what will you do then?

41:42.249 --> 41:43.083
Tell me.

41:43.918 --> 41:46.337
After rallying people in this weather
to make a fuss

41:46.420 --> 41:50.049
and mocking another team
by reopening a closed case, huh?

41:50.883 --> 41:52.927
There's no chance a body will be found.

41:58.933 --> 42:03.521
It's unfortunate when an investigator
decides the outcome from the start.

42:05.523 --> 42:08.359
Did you give up on everything
after being passed over?

42:10.110 --> 42:13.906
I'm hanging on to this case
because I haven't given up.

42:13.989 --> 42:17.826
So why the hell are you hanging on
to this case and not me?

42:19.328 --> 42:21.288
I'm the one who makes personnel decisions.

42:22.706 --> 42:24.750
That suicide note gives me justification.

42:26.835 --> 42:28.963
That's enough. You can go now.

43:17.720 --> 43:19.430
Have you ever seen this person?

43:19.513 --> 43:22.391
I can't say. We get a lot of customers.

43:37.072 --> 43:40.200
FUCK IT. I LOVE YOU

43:40.284 --> 43:41.285
Fuck it.

43:41.785 --> 43:42.786
I love you.

43:43.412 --> 43:45.372
Fuck it. I love you.

43:51.045 --> 43:52.755
FUCK IT. I LOVE YOU
MY LOVE DAMNED IT ALL

43:58.302 --> 44:00.512
WITH JI-HWON

44:01.388 --> 44:02.931
It's all there in the notebook.

44:03.015 --> 44:07.686
The secrets, tastes, and even minor habits
of the VIPs I managed.

44:07.770 --> 44:09.063
A REGULAR AT A MALE HOST BAR

44:09.146 --> 44:12.358
FELL FOR MALE ESCORT KANG JI-HWON
MADE HIM HER PERSONAL ASSISTANT

44:17.154 --> 44:18.572
It wasn't Choi Chae-u.

44:21.408 --> 44:22.910
It was Kang Ji-hwon.

44:35.422 --> 44:36.882
Did you bring a warrant?

44:38.133 --> 44:39.968
No, but I brought something else.

44:44.807 --> 44:46.517
Sarah Kim and Kang Ji-hwon.

44:46.600 --> 44:48.811
It turns out they were former lovers.

44:49.603 --> 44:51.772
Are you saying
they conspired to deceive me?

44:52.398 --> 44:54.692
Well, we'll find out once we investigate.

44:55.484 --> 44:58.821
And to do that, we need your cooperation.

44:58.904 --> 45:01.448
If you want the security footage,
you're too late.

45:01.532 --> 45:03.033
We've replaced the system.

45:03.117 --> 45:04.576
Never mind that.

45:05.661 --> 45:07.913
I noticed you own an aquarium as well.

45:08.747 --> 45:10.249
Would you mind giving me a fish?

45:11.583 --> 45:12.876
Sir!

45:13.919 --> 45:16.797
Where have you been?
You've been out of reach since yesterday.

45:16.880 --> 45:17.923
Fishing.

45:18.465 --> 45:20.092
What? Seriously?

45:20.175 --> 45:22.010
This is no time for hobbies.

45:22.094 --> 45:25.347
What did the section chief say?
Will he let us search the reservoir?

45:25.431 --> 45:27.683
No. I'm going to drop that.

45:28.308 --> 45:29.184
What?

45:32.312 --> 45:33.230
That's it?

45:33.313 --> 45:35.357
You're just accepting it without a fight?

45:36.191 --> 45:38.068
What do you expect me to say in protest?

45:38.694 --> 45:43.365
Do I say, "I haven't found anything yet,
but I'd like to keep investigating"?

45:43.449 --> 45:45.451
That's all the more reason to prove it!

45:45.951 --> 45:48.287
In times like these,
you should listen, not defy.

45:48.370 --> 45:49.663
I'm not defying you.

45:49.747 --> 45:51.248
But I won't listen either.

45:51.832 --> 45:53.751
You should at least do one of the two.

45:55.043 --> 45:57.421
Then you might find something
instead of whining.

45:57.504 --> 45:58.714
You're right.

45:59.214 --> 46:01.341
That's why I plan to do things my way.

46:12.144 --> 46:14.021
Is that what you ordered from Coupang?

46:14.104 --> 46:16.315
- What is that anyway?
- Isn't that an oxygen tank?

46:16.398 --> 46:19.485
Is that doing things your way?
Jumping in blind?

46:20.819 --> 46:22.196
Where are you going, kid?

46:26.366 --> 46:27.576
He's defying me, right?

46:35.876 --> 46:37.711
Hey, bring it over here!

46:39.588 --> 46:40.881
Right there. Yes.

46:43.926 --> 46:45.761
Bring it here!

46:46.428 --> 46:47.262
Hurry!

46:48.764 --> 46:50.265
Yes, we've got it.

46:51.099 --> 46:53.936
Excuse me, sir,
but this area is off-limits to the public.

46:54.019 --> 46:54.853
Please leave.

46:54.937 --> 46:56.438
What's going on?

46:56.522 --> 46:59.900
Last night, a fisherman reported
seeing piranhas in here.

47:00.400 --> 47:01.693
We're draining it.

47:01.777 --> 47:02.945
Please leave.

47:03.028 --> 47:04.488
Are you done wasting time?

47:06.114 --> 47:07.658
This way!

47:09.326 --> 47:10.661
What's all this?

47:10.744 --> 47:11.829
Coffee.

47:16.542 --> 47:18.168
Piranhas in the middle of winter?

47:18.252 --> 47:20.337
Are you behind all this?

47:24.633 --> 47:25.676
Justification.

47:32.057 --> 47:33.392
Keep sending it over.

47:39.273 --> 47:40.148
Over here!

47:40.232 --> 47:41.483
Over here!

47:42.067 --> 47:43.569
Quick! Hurry up!

47:46.488 --> 47:48.824
I wish I could be born again.

48:05.007 --> 48:06.884
Where did things go wrong?

48:14.725 --> 48:15.726
Excuse me.

48:19.730 --> 48:22.900
Where did things go wrong?

49:48.360 --> 49:53.365
Subtitle translation by: Yung Un Choi
